# What the EAS build uploads to Expo. The build only compiles portal-vila-app, so the API, its Render
# configuration and the design files stay out of the upload.
# This file replaces .gitignore for the upload, so the rules of .gitignore are repeated below.

portal-vila-api/
wireframes/
pdf_extract.txt
render.yaml
RENDER_DEPLOY.md
portal-vila-app/store/

node_modules/
dist/
target/
uploads/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
.env
.env.*
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.original
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
